  "description": "I am seeking approval to change the windows facing the street, on the second floor of the building. The building is opposite the fire station.\nThese are 3 windows, one per room and one of a smaller size in the kitchen.\nThese are sash windows with simple glazing glass panels, these are not the original windows of the building. Though I don't know when the change of windows has been done in the past. The timber frames are in poor condition, getting porous. \n\nThe intention is to change these 3 windows for like-to-like windows in terms of material: timber wood and replace for sash window of the same size and structure. I am applying to get these windows changed for double-glazing ones in order to maximise heating efficiency and reduce noise coming from the street activity. In one of the room there is a big fireplace which creates quite a lot of draughts though a canopy has been installed to close as much as possible of the air exhaustion. This replacement, if granted, would improve the living conditions of the flat to more standards ones : heating efficency and noise reduction.",
